e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wRemUSkn38Q7kNvwGA0_4R&_nc_oc=Adp3YRz0OQKcQrmZlkTIFLjNko3w88uevszInwHEEy7x1NpRkrAUv91ioteEQ5TZ8Xw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af15Xic0d9DgL3BgoB3UMaBq3ngsRLfcV0ZD_HeIs5ajCA&oe=69F764F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mFN3F25Jgd8Q7kNvwGDhfX7&_nc_oc=AdpDob6csiB4tQ8iTb5bykh9zJ6dSaK7Zz52VMClns3jtzxpUFyMei44UCXylcnE9Ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1SRWOM_cx8jb3RBh-BKCFQBxHmSvs4RGYTKO1kpVqC5w&oe=69F73C53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1jM5TpQwpXcQ7kNvwEjPoEa&_nc_oc=Adqs8Xcqxno7f3-Qtddqns6iH7vfVSXJ7K9MPsg29EWm05QUA8Z3lYo7bXN-1KEu3Ys&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2fFIzgEKzgHJREiwBHkTyT1P1rhi0spJa1rHlXDNNKHg&oe=69F747FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C3xHjp6Ws_sQ7kNvwHqocA8&_nc_oc=AdpuLHCeDJbB7b9DGGvUW5AyOlPBePiRM7VXi1803biyenxsMXaZUOfDkbjfKjkV2hw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1lUWYHuDK5IDHEItKDk9sfUomKtwjOIFPY3ewbVBeL1w&oe=69F7494A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y5xV_mlsE4YQ7kNvwFIOSel&_nc_oc=AdrD_mVd3mEwsvZv9CcKcrUcVkvOZYj7oE0xGNjoDA9PXeLPzGaUdsDSIBBzdK2l29A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3GMB9_V3CnJxopop5_vPbmUShHPqtT0fgUB7Xb61ExQQ&oe=69F76ABE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se